  "summary": "This table outlines the quantities of electric meters required per electrical company and their associated delivery schedules. The data is organized into four main item sections: ITEM 1: SINGLE PHASE METER 2 WIRES - MODEL HXE12ES, ITEM 2: SINGLE PHASE METER 3 WIRES - MODEL HXE13ES, ITEM 3: THREE PHASE METER 3 WIRES - MODEL HXE33K-S1, and ITEM 4: THREE PHASE METER 4 WIRES - MODEL HXE34K-S1. Within each section, rows represent individual electrical companies, including ELUC, ADINELSA, ELSU, ELCTO, ENOSA, HDNA, ENSA, ELOR - LORETO, ELSE, SEAL, ELOR - SAN MARTIN, ELOR - CAJAMARCA, and ELPU. The columns detail COMPANY, ITEM, DESCRIPTION (such as Single Phase Meter 2 wires, Single Phase Meter 3 wires, Three Phase 3 wires, and Three Phase 4 wires), UNIT, TOTAL REQUIREMENT, and QTY AND DELIVERY SCHEDULE. The delivery schedule is subdivided across six intervals: 1st Delivery (At 170 days of contract signature), 2nd Delivery (At 210 days of contract signature), 3rd Delivery (At 330 days of contract signature), 4th Delivery (At 450 days of contract signature), 5th Delivery (At 570 days of contract signature), and 6th Delivery (At 690 days of contract signature), reporting meter quantities per delivery."
